document.body.innerHTML=`<header class="site-header"><div class="shell"><div class="topbar"><a class="brand" href="index.html"><span class="brandmark">${icon('layers')}</span><span>AI 闯关学习<small>把好奇心，变成真正学会的知识</small></span></a><div class="top-actions"><span class="demo-label">交互原型 · 示例数据</span><button class="site-btn primary" data-action="launch">${icon('route','small-icon')} 连续体验</button></div></div><nav class="section-nav" aria-label="原型分组"><a href="index.html" class="${index?'active':''}">总览</a>${nav}</nav></div></header><main class="shell">${index?`<section class="index-hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">${icon('spark','small-icon')} 每一次好奇，都值得弄明白</div><h1>把好奇心，变成<br>真正学会的知识。</h1><p>从一段文字、一份资料开始。让 AI 帮你梳理知识，用一道道好问题检验理解，把每次收获留在自己的学习记录里。</p><div class="hero-actions"><button class="site-btn primary" data-action="launch">开始完整体验 ${icon('arrow','small-icon')}</button><a class="site-btn" href="01-start-and-sources.html">浏览全部页面</a></div></div><div class="journey" aria-label="资料连接知识与学习成果"><div class="journey-item">${icon('file')}<strong>你的资料</strong><small>好奇从这里开始</small></div><div class="journey-item">${icon('route')}<strong>一题一理解</strong><small>思考、反馈、再想</small></div><div class="journey-item">${icon('award')}<strong>自己的收获</strong><small>复盘让理解留下</small></div></div></section><div class="index-groups">${D.groups.map(x=>`<a href="${x.file}" class="group-link"><span>${icon(x.icon)}</span><div><strong>${x.title}</strong><p>${x.names.length} 个页面与状态 · ${x.key}01–${x.key}${String(x.names.length).padStart(2,'0')}</p></div>${icon('arrow','arrow small-icon')}</a>`).join('')}</div><div class="gallery-toolbar"><h2>从输入，到收获</h2><span class="small muted">三张画板，先认识它</span></div>`:`<section class="intro"><div><div class="eyebrow">${icon(g.icon,'small-icon')} 完整学习体验 / ${g.short}</div><h1>${g.title}</h1><p>${g.desc}</p></div><div class="intro-aside"><strong>${g.names.length}</strong> 个页面与状态<br>桌面三列 · 平板两列 · 手机单列</div></section><div class="gallery-toolbar"><h2>页面画板</h2><label><span class="sr-only">跳转到画板</span><select id="jump"><option value="">快速定位页面</option>${g.names.map((n,i)=>`<option value="${g.key}${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}">${g.key}${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} ${n}</option>`).join('')}</select></label></div>`}<div class="screen-grid" id="gallery"></div><p class="review-note">画板支持选择、展开与状态切换；“单独体验”可进入连续流程。所有内容均为固定示例，文件不上传，AI 生成、微信授权与分享均未连接真实服务。</p><footer class="foot"><span>AI 闯关学习 · 交互设计原型<br>6 个分组 / 60 个页面与状态 / 轻交互演示</span><span><a href="index.html">返回原型总览</a>　<a href="../design/UI原型草图与风格提案.md">设计提案</a><br>知识蓝 · 清晰内容 · 可靠来源</span></footer></main><div id="toast" class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>`;
